window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The Angels are calling, and so her hunt begins.</b><br> <br> After the devastation on Daminius, Ophelia threw herself into restoration to cope with her losses. Two months later, answers to an ancient curse still evade her, a queen threatens her life, and war rages in the southern mountains. Despite her scars and the loved ones lost, Ophelia knows she must move forward for her people.<br> <br> When a note arrives with the clue they've been hoping for, Ophelia and her friends embark on a journey that will test their bonds and their faith in the Angels.<br> <br> Ophelia must unravel legends while navigating a budding romance and trying to hold the Mystiques together—even if it means sacrificing herself.<br> <br> <i>The Trials of Ophelia</i> is the third installment in the new adult romantic fantasy series, the Curse of Ophelia. With roots in Greek mythology, heartrending love stories, found family, and a unique fantastical world, this series is perfect for fans of Carissa Broadbent, Chloe C. Peñaranda, and Sarah J. Maas.<br> <br> Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
